sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant Bureau as Bureau Service
    participant Vendor as Credit Bureau
    participant DB as Bureau DB
    participant Kafka as Event Bus

    WF->>Bureau: Perform bureau check
    Bureau->>Vendor: Fetch credit report
    Vendor-->>Bureau: Credit score & tradelines
    Bureau->>DB: Persist bureau result
    DB-->>Bureau: Commit success
    Bureau->>Kafka: Publish BUREAU_CHECKED
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Proceed to eligibility
